@startuml
title Tenant Switching — Authentication Stays, Actor Changes

actor User
participant Browser
participant "ERS API" as API
database "Session" as Session
database "Account Actor Bindings" as Bindings

User -> Browser : Select Tenant A
Browser -> API : Request\nX-Tenant-ID: A
API -> Session : Resolve accountId
API -> Bindings : accountId + Tenant A
Bindings --> API : Actor A
API --> Browser : Tenant-A context

User -> Browser : Switch to Tenant B
Browser -> API : Request\nX-Tenant-ID: B
API -> Session : Resolve same accountId
API -> Bindings : accountId + Tenant B
Bindings --> API : Actor B
API --> Browser : Tenant-B context

note over Session
Authentication Account:
unchanged

Session:
unchanged
end note

note over Bindings
Effective Actor:
Actor A -> Actor B

Tenant:
A -> B

Roles:
A roles -> B roles
end note

@enduml